HSS: PROFFER
VERSION: 1

PROGRAM: Proffer
ROOT: proffer/src/main
LANGUAGES: C, C++, Java

PURPOSE:
  Define a compact process/memory model with a three-dimensional state space
  and an explicit SecureJDK/Graal awareness boundary.

MODEL:
  Vec3 = (x, y, z)
  MemoryObject = (id, position, mass, born_tick)
  NetUniverse = (net_center, perfection_tolerance)
  ProcessDiagonal = (start, end, process_time)

OPERATIONS:
  proffer_memory_fall(object, tick)
    age = max(tick - object.born_tick, 0)
    result = object.position
    result.z = result.z - age
    return result

  proffer_diagonalize(ram, processor, process_time)
    return ProcessDiagonal(ram, processor, process_time)

AWARENESS:
  ABI_VERSION = 1
  NET_CENTER = 2.0
  REQUIRED_FLAGS:
    3D_SPACE
    MEMORY_TIME
    PROCESS_DIAGONAL
    FIELTER
    PROFFER

VALIDATION:
  Awareness is complete only when ABI_VERSION == 1,
  NET_CENTER == 2.0, and every required feature flag is present.

BOUNDARY:
  The native awareness layer contains no OS hooks and no privilege escalation.
  It is a model/runtime interface for later platform-specific adapters.

SOURCE:
  c/net_universe.c
  c/net_universe.h
  c/proffer_model_notes.c
  c/securejdk_awareness.c
  c/securejdk_awareness.h

EXTENSIONS:
  C++ and Java directories are reserved for future implementations and
  bindings. Keep the model semantics compatible with this specification.
